    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42481" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρῑν-εός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wild fig-tree, Ficus Caprificus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.433
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				557b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
